WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.970
This is TACIT.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:12.340
Mouth your words silently, and your Mac speaks them, in a voice

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.760
you choose, only after you approve.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.020
Recognition isn't perfect, so nothing is spoken until you decide.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.730
Here, "doing" came back as "going".

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:25.580
You see it.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.430
You fix it.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.800
[TACIT voice] “How are you doing?”

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.020
When the words are right, one tap on Speak sends exactly those

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:42.230
words, in the voice you chose, into your call's microphone.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.510
And Stop is always one tap away.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.580
But a conversation is more than sentences.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.380
It's timing.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:52.420
Hold my turn keeps your place, so nobody talks over you while

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:53.210
you compose.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.990
[TACIT voice] “One moment, I'm responding.”

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:56.690
We're early.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.380
Accuracy varies, and TACIT hasn't been tested with people who've

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:01.370
lost their voice.

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:04.940
But we think everyone deserves more ways to be heard, on their

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:05.520
own terms.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.510
TACIT.

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:08.450
Your words.

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:09.390
Your voice.

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:10.580
Beyond speech.
